ed to industry relevant topics lies at foundation of our management programs. Pedagogical tools that encompass case studies, lectures by industry experts and visits to industry strengthen a student’s perspective and help the school in achieving its cherished mission of preparing future managers. The students’ summer internship program is aimed at buttressing the learning of student in the class with gaining experience while working with industry.","In order to quench the entrepreneurial thirst of aspiring students, the centre of excellence for Startups and Entrepreneurship provides mentoring support and financial assistance to eligible student startups. So be it your desire for making a corporate career or starting your own business, KSBM is the place to be in!","Come and shape your dreams at KPGU !"]})]})}),r.jsx("div",{style:{padding:"20px 0 0 0"},id:"vision",children:r.jsxs(w,{bgcolor:"#fff",borderRadius:4,className:"smooth-shadow",p:"3%",maxWidth:e,mx:"auto",children:[r.jsx("h2",{className:"fw-bold color-secondary fs-1",children:"Vision"}),r.jsx(Qe,{quote:"To be a center of excellence in all facets of management education and to producevivacious leaders with functional competencies, empathetic and socially responsible,sustainability and entrepreneurial perspective to enhance employability and embrace theroots of Indian ethos and values.",right:!0})]})}),r.jsx("div",{style:{padding:"20px 0 0 0"},id:"mission",children:r.jsxs(w,{bgcolor:"#fff",borderRadius:4,className:"smooth-shadow",p:"3%",maxWidth:e,mx:"auto",children:[r.jsx("h2",{className:"fw-bold color-secondary fs-1",children:"Mission"}),i.map((s,l)=>r.jsxs(ce,{direction:"row",mb:1,textAlign:"justify",children:[r.jsx(w,{children:r.jsx(ze,{sx:{fontSize:"25px"}})}),r.jsx(w,{children:r.jsx("h4",{children:s})})]},l))]})}),r.jsx("div",{style:{padding:"20px 0 0 0"},id:"faculty",children:r.jsxs(w,{bgcolor:"#fff",borderRadius:4,className:"smooth-shadow",p:"3%",maxWidth:e,mx:"auto",children:[r.jsx(w,{mb:4,children:r.j