end global standards.","To provide a wider platform for the industry, academician and management practitioners to share profound experience and astute knowledge.","To collaborate with various stakeholders to establish Start-up Ecosystem to accelerate employability and sustainable economic growth.","To ingrain professional ethics to achieve sustainable growth and standard business practices","To foster Indian ethos & values to transform empathetic and responsible business leaders."],s=[{name:"Dr. Rashmi Vyas",designation:"Director I/C",experience:26,imgNo:"6113",qualification:"P.hd || M.B.A. || M.Phil || M.Com || B.Com",customLink:"https://res.cloudinary.com/dby2vbxv3/image/upload/v1727170858/KPGU/Faculty%20Images/KSC/dsc-9410-copy-66f2890b1ec76_j68vxe.webp"},{name:"Mr. Kushal Jayesh Sampat",designation:"Assistant Professor",experience:9,imgNo:"6062",qualification:"C.S. || C.A.[Finalist]CMA || B.Com",customLink:""},{name:"Darshna Mistry",designation:"Assistant Professor",imgNo:"",qualification:"M.Com. || B.Com",customLink:""},{name:"Dasatgira S Nakum",designation:"Assistant Professor",imgNo:"",qualification:"M.Com. || B.Com",customLink:""}];return r.jsxs(r.Fragment,{children:[r.jsx(Ke,{value:n,children:r.jsx(w,{className:"smooth-shadow",bgcolor:"rgba(256, 256, 256, 0.6)",sx:{backdropFilter:"blur(10px)"},p:2,borderRadius:4,mt:7,position:"sticky",top:0,maxWidth:e,mx:"auto",zIndex:99999999,children:r.jsxs(Ve,{onChange:i,"aria-label":"lab API tabs example",orientation:"horizontal",textColor:"secondary",indicatorColor:"secondary",variant:"scrollable",children:[r.jsx(G,{className:"align-items-start fw-bold text-start  fs-5",label:"Message From Director",value:"1",href:"#director-message"}),r.jsx(G,{className:"align-items-start fw-bold text-start  fs-5",label:"vision",value:"2",href:"#vision"}),r.jsx(G,{className:"align-items-start fw-bold text-start  fs-5",label:"mission",value:"3",href:"#mission"}),r.jsx(G,{className:"align-items-start fw-bold text-start  fs-5",label:"Faculty",value:"4",href:"#faculty"}),r.jsx(G,{className:"align-items-start fw-bold text-start  fs-5",label:"Programs",value:"5",href:"#program"})]})})}),r.jsx("div",{style:{padding:"40px 0 0 0"},id:"director-message",children:r.jsxs(w,{maxWidth:e,mx:"auto",p:"5%",bgcolor:"#fff",borderRadius:4,className:"smooth-shadow",children:[r.jsx(gr,{title:"Krishna School of Commerce [KSC]"}),r.jsx(vr,{dirImg:"https://res.cloudinary.com/dby2vbxv3/image/upload/v1727170858/KPGU/Faculty%20Images/KSC/dsc-9410-copy-66f2890b1ec76_j68vxe.webp",dirEmail:"dir.ksc@kpgu.ac.in",dirName:"DR. RASHMI VYAS",dirOf:"Krishna School of Commerce",dirOfShort:"[KSC]",dirMessage:["Krishna School of Commerce (KSC) strives to inculcate discipline and character building along with serious pursuit of knowledge utilizing the advanced teaching practices and high moral standards.  Our institution not only pursues academic excellence but also motivates and empowers the students to be lifelong learners, critical thinkers and productive members of an ever changing global society.","We take immense pride in the fact that our students receive the quality education.  This is made possible by following high standards of teaching and learning.  Our excellence is not just confined to the classroom; we are also notably active in conducting workshops, seminars, guest lectures, industrial visits and other co-curricular activities.  These activities expose students to aspects beyond curriculum, thus adding high value to their professional success. We follow “mentor system” under which each class is put into the multi-pronged web of a teacher.","The core objective of Our Institution strives to inculcate discipline and character building along with serious pursuit of knowledge utilizing the most advanced teaching practices and high moral standards.","Our aim is to develop highly competent knowledge leaders and entrepreneurs and make every effort to shape the students into responsible citizens.  Holistic training that goes beyond education is imparted to students through extra-curricular activities, skill enhancement programs and sports activities to develop them into all rounded persons.","We aim to empower students to exercise their talents responsibly by leading a fulfilling life and making an active contribution towards social justice and common goal.","I also laud the relentless efforts of our teachers for giving their best in bringing out the best in each student. But I would exhort the students to be always modest, humble and disciplined while being ready to expand the horizons of their knowledge and skills by dreaming big and working hard. Teamwork is the hallmark of KSC.","I am very sure through collaborative effort we can achieve more to benefit our students who are the future leaders of tomorrow."]})]})}),r.jsx("div",{style:{padding:"40px 0 0 0"},id:"vision",children:r.jsxs(w,{bgcolor:"#fff",borderRadius:4,className:"smooth-shadow",p:"5%",maxWidth:e,mx:"auto",children:[r.jsx("h2",{className:"fw-bold color-secondary fs-1",children:"Vision"}),r.jsx(Qe,{quote:"Commitment to pursue excellence in commerce education, while equipping students with knowledge and skills in commerce stream, inculcate values, identify hidden talents, provide opportunities for students so as to create successful entrepreneurs as well as competent human resource with global competency suitable for trade, service and industry there by contributing well-being of society and national development.",right:!0})]})}),r.jsx("div",{style:{padding:"40px 0 0 0"},id:"mission",children:r.jsxs(w,{bgcolor:"#fff",borderRadius:4,className:"smooth-shadow",p:"5%",maxWidth:e,mx:"auto",children:[r.jsx("h2",{className:"fw-bold color-secondary fs-1",children:"Mission"}),o.map((l,c)=>r.jsxs(ce,{direction:"row",mb:1,textAlign:"justify",children:[r.jsx(w,{children:r.jsx(ze,{sx:{fontSize:"25px"}})}),r.jsx(w,{children:r.jsx("h4",{children:l})})]},c))]})}),r.jsx("div",{style:{padding:"40px 0 0 0"},id:"faculty",children:r.jsxs(w,{bgcolo