m-solving skills, ability and innovation of new age technologies. The course contents are periodically updated based on recent trends for introducing new scientific and technological developments. Various activities such as expert lectures, industrial visits, project / activity-based learning (PBL / ABL) are carried out for the technical and soft skill development of students. Along with technical development we also focus on developing a responsible citizen by promoting awareness of safety, environmental and social issues in students.","The Department is acting like incubation center in shaping the professional life of students & initiated various processes & imparting innovative teaching methodologies for the improvement of academic, industrial and professional culture."]})})}function zae(){return r.jsxs(w,{borderRadius:4,children:[r.jsx("h2",{className:"text-uppercase fw-bold color-secondary mb-4",children:"About Department"}),r.jsx(Je,{content:["Chemical Engineering Department at the Krishna School of Diploma Studies, Krishna Edu Campus under the Drs. Kiran & Pallavi Patel Global University (KPGU), Vadodara is established in year of 2023, and is one of the premier chemical engineering education centers in Gujarat. The department has well qualified diverse faculty members not only in terms of their background, but also in terms of their field of expertise and academic background. This fusion of industrial, research and academic experience will be the important aspects in creation of the right environment for academic and intellectual growth of the students. This is evident for the university rankings and placement records.","Chemical Engineering Department at KPGU is now recognized at various national and international platforms through representation of dedicated faculty members. Also, Chemical Engineering Department has vision to become a global leading chemical engineering department imparting quality education, training and conducting research in chemical and allied interdisciplinary areas for the sustainable development of the society. The Department of Chemical Engineering is committed to grow further as a socially responsible and research-oriented center of learning.","To augment teaching, learning and research, department has well established state of art laboratories for, where practice-oriented learning is imparted to the students. The departmental library helps the students in having ready references. Industrial visits, Workshop, Expert talks, etc. are the regular features of the department."]})]})}function Vae(){const{maxWidth:e}=p.useContext(X),t=[{name:"Jimit H. Kansara",imgNo:"",designation:"HOD-Chemical || Lecturer",experience:9,qualification:"B.E[Chemical]",customLink:"https://res.cloudinary.com/dby2vbxv3/image/upload/v1710304615/KPGU/Faculty%20Images/KSDS/0881.webp"},{name:"Dr. YagneshKumar Alkeshbhai Vyas",imgNo:"",designation:"Assistant professor ",experience:9,qualification:"PhD[Pursuing] || M.sc[Chemistry]",customLink:"https://res.cloudinary.com/dby2vbxv3/image/upload/v1710310594/KPGU/Faculty%20Images/KSDS/YagneshKumar-Alkeshbhai-Vyas.webp"},{name:"Shreya Tailor",imgNo:"",designation:"Lecturer",experience:8,qualification:"B.E. Chemical",customLink:""},{name:"Janvi Joshi",imgNo:"",designation:"Lecturer",qualification:"M.Sc. || B.Sc.",customLink:""}];return r.jsx(w,{maxWidth:e,mx:"auto",bgcolor:"#fff",borderRadius:4,children:r.jsx(k,{container:!0,spacing:2,children:t.map(({name:n,designation:a,experience:i,qualification:o,imgNo:s,customLink:l},c)=>r.jsx(Qt,{name:n,qualification:o,designation:a,experience:i,facultyName:"KSET",imgNo:s,MainLink:"https://res.cloudinary.com/dby2vbxv3/image/upload/v1707801651/KPGU/Faculty%20Images/",customLink:l,insideTab:!0},c))})})}function Hae(){const e=["To develop and mentor socially responsible, environmentally conscious and ethically upright professionals, equipped with state-of-the-art knowledge and skills.","To interact continuously with the industries and society at large to respond effectively to their needs.","To foster industry-academia relationships for mutual benefit, development and growth.","To prepare competent chemical engineers with leadership qualities.","To develop modern chemical engineering laboratories and research facilities."];return r.jsxs(r.Fragment,{children:[r.jsxs(w,{borderRadius:4,className:"smooth-shadow-card p-3",children:[r.jsx("h2",{className:"fw-bold color-secondary fs-1",children:"Vision"}),r.jsx(Qe,{quote:"To be a global leading chemical engineering department imparting quality education, training and conducting research in chemical and allied interdisciplinary areas for the sustainable development of the society.",right:!0})]}),r.jsxs(w,{mt:7,borderRadius:4,className:"smooth-shadow-card p-3",children:[r.jsx("h2",{className:"fw-bold color-secondary fs-1 mb-4",children:"Mission"}),r.jsx(w,{pl:2,color:"secondary.main",children:e.map((t,n)=>r.jsxs(ce,{direction:"row",mb:1,children:[r.jsx(w,{children:r.jsx(ze,{sx:{fontSize:"25px"}})}),r.jsx(w,{children:r.jsx("h4",{children:t})})]},n))})]})]})}function Wae(){const e=["To develop knowledge for overcoming challenges in the area of chemical engineering.","To deliver fundamentals of science, engineering and technology required to analyze and solve chemical engineering problems.","To develop professionals who will thrive to pursue skills of problem solving, communication, team work, life-long learning, leadership, professional ethics and values. "],t=["Understand and apply basic concepts of Chemical Engineering necessary for working in industry or in engineering practices as well as higher study.","Apply the fundamental knowledge of Chemical Engineering to solve technical problems using engineering equations and principles."],n=["Apply knowledge of basic mathematics, science and engineering fundamentals and engineering specialization to solve the engineering problems.","Identify and analyze well-defined engineering problems using codified standard methods.","Design solutions for well-defined technical problems and assist with the design of systems components or processes to meet specified needs.","Apply modern engineering tools and appropriate technique to conduct standard tests and measurements. ","Apply appropriate technology in context of society, sustainability, environment and ethical practices.","Use engineering management principles individually, as a team member or a leader to manage projects and effectively communicate about well-defined engineering activities.","Ability to analyze individual needs and engage in updating in the context of technological changes."],a=({sentence:i})=>r.jsx("div",{className:"smooth-shadow p-2 rounded-2 fs-5 fw-semibold color-secondary mt-2",children:i});return r.jsxs("div",{children:[r.jsx("h2",{className:" fw-bold color-secondary mb-2",children:"PROGRAM EDUCATIONAL OBJECTIVES [PEOs]"}),e.map((i,o)=>r.jsx(a,{sentence:i},o)),r.jsx("h2",{className:" fw-bold color-secondary mb-2 mt-4",children:"PROGRAM SPECIFIC OUTCOMES [PSOs]"}),r.jsx("h5",{children:"The curriculum of chemical engineering is designed to prepare graduates to attain the following program-specific outcomes:"}),t.map((i,o)=>r.jsx(a,{sentence:i},o)),r.jsx("h2",{className:" fw-bold color-secondary mb-2 mt-4",children:"PROGRAM OUTCOMES [POs]"}),r.jsx("h5",{children:"The curriculum of chemical engineering is designed to prepare graduates to attain the following program-specific outcomes:"}),n.map((i,o)=>r.jsx(a,{sentence:i},o))]})}function qae(){const{maxWidth:e,innerWidth:t}=p.useContext(X),[n,a]=Pe.useState("1"),i=(o,s)=>{a(s)};return r.jsx(r.Fragment,{children:r.jsx(Ke,{value:n,children:r.jsxs(k,{container:!0,maxWidth:e,mx:"auto",mt:7,children:[r.jsx(k,{item:!0,xs:12,md:3,pb:4,children:r.jsx(w,{className:"smooth-shadow",bgcolor:"#fff",p:2,borderRadius:4,position:"sticky",top:0,children:r.jsxs(Ve,{onChange:i,"aria-label":"lab API tabs example",orientation:`${t<900?"horizontal":"vertical"}`,textColor:"secondary",indicatorColor:"secondary",variant:"scrollable",children:[r.jsx(G,{className:"align-items-start fw-bold text-start ",label:"Message From HOD",value:"1"}),r.jsx(G,{className:"align-items-start fw-bold text-start ",label:"About Department",value:"2"}),r.jsx(G,{className:"align-items-start fw-bold text-start ",label:"Vision And Mission",value:"3"}),r.jsx(G,{className:"align-items-start fw-bold text-start ",label:"Objectives & Outcomes",value:"4"}),r.jsx(G,{className:"align-items-start fw-bold text-start ",label:"Faculty",value:"6"})]})})}),r.jsx(k,{item:!0,xs:12,md:9,pl:t<900?"0":4,children:r.jsxs(w,{className:"smooth-shadow",bgcolor:"#fff",borderRadius:4,children:[r.jsx(W,{value:"1",children:r.jsx($ae,{})}),r.jsx(W,{value:"2",children:r.jsx(zae,{})}),r.jsx(W,{value:"3",children:r.jsx(Hae,{})}),r.jsx(W,{value:"4",children:r.jsx(Wae,{})}),r.jsx(W,{value:"6",children:r.jsx(Vae,{})})]})})]})})})}function Yae(){return p.useContext(X),r.jsxs(r.Fragment,{children:[r.jsx(In,{hodImg:"https://res.cloudinary.com/dby2vbxv3/image/upload/v1708500691/KPGU/Faculty%20Images/KSET/Director.webp",hodEmail:"hod.CE.kset@kpgu.ac.in",hodName:"Dr. Nitesh Sureja",hodOf:"Computer Engineering",hodOfShort:"[KST]",hodMessage:["You are invited to join the vibrant computer science community and become the future’s innovators and change agents by enrolling in the Department of Computer Science and Engineering. The Department of CE was established in 2004. Our esteemed faculties guarantee a wide range of diverse learning experiences, including Core Courses, Programming and, Emerging Technologies","Our department of computer science and engineering (CE) is committed to giving its students excellent jobs. Our teachers and students are always pushing the boundaries of what is possible in computer science and engineering. We do not try to turn our students into walking manuals for any particular language or software. They are instead given a solid foundation in computer science and problem-solving methods, and they are made adaptable to changes with a strong emphasis on context and project-based learning through mini-projects, industry visits, guest lectures, student activities & leadership events, professional societies like Computer Society of India, and an incubation center.","The Department is proud of its robust network of alumni, many of whom hold important positions in academics and business related to information technology on both a national and international scale. We welcome talented students, researchers, academics, and workers to join us and contribute to the campus’s vibrant and competitive learning environment. Additionally, the CE department has MoUs with some of the finest organizations and works to further strengthen them.","The placement record of qualified students over the past several years has been excellent, and they are now employed by reputable firms. In order to explore and invent new methods and find sustainable solutions, students and teachers are constantly working on exciting and fascinating problems or projects that are published in numerous national and foreign journals."]}),r.jsx(Qe,{quote:"With the idea that mentoring is a lifetime commitment, we motivate students to achieve academic excellence with valuable life lessons"})]})}function Jae(){return r.jsxs(w,{borderRadius:4,children:[r.jsx("h2",{className:"text-uppercase fw-bold color-secondary mb-4",children:"About Department"}),r.jsx(Je,{content:["In the Institute, the Department of Computer Science & Engineering was established in 2004.The department aims wants to offer top-notch computer science education. The controlling centre of computing for the full institute is operated by the Department of Computer Science & Engineering.","Our knowledgeable faculty exposes aspiring computer engineers to a demanding and thorough industry-focused curriculum created to bring out the best in them and keep them up to date with the most cutting-edge technology. Our curriculum progressively improves students’ technical and soft skills. Along with teaching theory, a lot of emphasis is placed on projects, industrial training, and certification.","Our department’s area of emphasis is on institute-industry interface programmes that let students engage with businesses constantly. Equal weight is given to classroom instruction, which is intended to provide theoretical or conceptual knowledge inputs on a range of projects.","The B.Tech Computer Science & Engineering program places a strong focus on the theoretical and practical aspects of Computer Programming, Database Management System, Advance Software Design and Development, System Programming, Internet of Things & Hardware, Wireless & Mobile Computing, Computer Graphics, Web Programming and Development, Operating Systems, AI & ML, Big Data Analytics, and Cyber Security.","The program offers a variety of employment opportunities on both the domestic and international markets. The department has been set up where innovative activities are planned and carried out, and is equipped with the most recent PCs, software, and hands-on expertise for providing high-quality education.","It continues to be the top option among all applicants for admittance to KSET. The young talent that aspires to study, teach, or create in the field of computer science is warmly welcomed by our team. So join us by coming."]})]})}function Qae(){const e=[{title:"Data Structure and Algorithms Lab",img:"https://res.cloudinary.com/dby2vbxv3/image/upload/v1721906437/KPGU/Images/Labs/KSET-Computer-Science-And-Engineering/data-structure-and-algorithms-lab-66a234d2e2106_ikzxkl.webp"},{title:"Computer Programming Lab",img:"https://res.cloudinary.com/dby2vbxv3/image/upload/v1721906437/KPGU/Images/Labs/KSET-Computer-Science-And-Engineering/computer-programming-lab-66a234d335272_mmehfx.webp"},{title:"Database Management System Lab",img:"https://res.cloudinary.com/dby2vbxv3/image/upload/v1721906437/KPGU/Images/Labs/KSET-Computer-Science-And-Engineering/database-