stitution and to check the menace of ragging."})]}),r.jsx("div",{id:"disciplinary-actions",children:r.jsx(w,{maxWidth:e,mx:"auto",p:"3%",bgcolor:"#fff",mt:7,borderRadius:4,className:"smooth-shadow",children:r.jsxs(k,{container:!0,spacing:2,children:[r.jsx(k,{item:!0,xs:12,sm:12,md:4,children:r.jsx(w,{className:"smooth-shadow-card",height:"100%",children:r.jsx("img",{src:"https://res.cloudinary.com/dby2vbxv3/image/upload/v1710492423/KPGU/Images/anti-ragging/h4bcn0ynsffufeofnyp8.jpg",className:"w-100 h-100 object-fit-fill ",alt:""})})}),r.jsx(k,{item:!0,xs:12,sm:12,md:7,children:r.jsxs(w,{className:"",children:[r.jsx("h3",{className:"fw-bold color-secondary ",children:"Legal Measures and Disciplinary Actions for Ragging"}),r.jsx("h5",{className:"fw-semibold mb-3 ",children:"Ragging is a criminal offense. Ragging is strictly prohibited by both State Govt. and Central Govt. Punishment for ragging will be as follows:"}),r.jsxs(w,{m:1,children:[r.jsx("h5",{className:"mb-2 p-2 smooth-shadow-card rounded-2 color-secondary fw-bold ",children:"Cancellation of admission."}),r.jsx("h5",{className:"mb-2 p-2 smooth-shadow-card rounded-2 color-secondary fw-bold ",children:"Suspension from attending classes."}),r.jsx("h5",{className:"mb-2 p-2 smooth-shadow-card rounded-2 color-secondary fw-bold ",children:"Withholding/withdrawing scholarship/fellowship and other benefits."}),r.jsx("h5",{className:"mb-2 p-2 smooth-shadow-card rounded-2 color-secondary fw-bold ",children:"Debarring from appearing in any test/examination, placement activities, or other evaluation processes."}),r.jsx("h5",{className:"mb-2 p-2 smooth-shadow-card rounded-2 color-secondary fw-bold ",children:"Withholding results."}),r.jsx("h5",{className:"mb-2 p-2 smooth-shadow-card rounded-2 color-secondary fw-bold ",children:"Debarring from representing the institution in any regional, national, or international meet, tournament, youth festival, etc."}),r.jsx("h5",{className:"mb-2 p-2 smooth-shadow-card rounded-2 color-secondary fw-bold ",children:"Suspension/expulsion from the Hall of Residence."}),r.jsxs("h5",{className:"mb-2 p-2 smooth-shadow-card rounded-2 color-secondary fw-bold ",children:["Rustication from the University."," "]}),r.jsx("h5",{className:"mb-2 p-2 smooth-shadow-card rounded-2 color-secondary fw-bold ",children:"Expulsion from the institution and consequent debarring from admission to any other institution."}),r.jsxs("h5",{className:"mb-2 p-2 smooth-shadow-card rounded-2 color-secondary fw-bold ",children:["Fine will be imposed as per severity of an offense."," "]}),r.jsx("h5",{className:"mb-2 p-2 smooth-shadow-card rounded-2 color-secondary fw-bold ",children:"Collective punishment: when the persons committing or abetting the crime of ragging are not identified, the institution will resort to collective punishment as a deterrent to ensure community pressure on the potential offenders"})]})]})})]})})}),r.jsx("div",{id:"objectives",children:r.jsxs(w,{maxWidth:e,mx:"auto",p:"3%",bgcolor:"#fff",mt:7,borderRadius:4,className:"smooth-shadow",textAlign:{xs:"start",sm:"justify"},children:[r.jsx("h3",{className:"fw-bold color-secondary ",children:"Objectives of Anti Ragging Committee"}),r.jsx("h5",{className:"fw-semibold mb-3 ",children:"Anti-Ragging Committee will be the supervisory and advisory committee in preserving a Culture of Ragging Free Environment in the university Campus. The main objectives of this cell are as follows:"}),r.jsxs(w,{m:1,children:[r.jsx("h5",{className:"mb-2 p-2 smooth-shadow-card rounded-2 color-secondary fw-bold ",children:"To aware the students of dehumanizing effect of ragging inherent in its perversity."}),r.jsx("h5",{className:"mb-2 p-2 smooth-shadow-card rounded-2 color-secondary fw-bold ",children:"To keep a continuous watch and vigil over ragging so as to prevent its occurrence and recurrence."}),r.jsx("h5",{className:"mb-2 p-2 smooth-shadow-card rounded-2 color-secondary fw-bold ",children:"To promptly and stringently deal with the 