vost, Smt. A.J. Patel, PSI and Ms. Archita Patel Surti, ,181 -ABHYAM- Women Helpline team and SHE team, Vadodara`,date:" 07/03/2024"},{img:"https://res.cloudinary.com/dby2vbxv3/image/upload/v1726738923/KPGU/Events/Internal%20Complaint%20Committee/abc2_Custom_fwmmie.jpg",title:"Empowerment Through Art: Poster Making Competition",des:`The poster competition titled "The Empowerment Through Art" has been formulated with a distinct and comprehensive aim of fostering self-awareness among our university's staff and students on from 5* March and 6* March 2024`,date:"05/03/2024"},{img:"https://res.cloudinary.com/dby2vbxv3/image/upload/v1726738923/KPGU/Events/Internal%20Complaint%20Committee/abc5_Custom_o1uudg.jpg",title:"An awareness program Sanitary vending machine Women in the Workplace",des:"Menopause Awareness seminar was organised on World menopause day or 18/10/2023 to raise awareness about menopause, eliminate its stigma, ano emphasise the resources available to help women improve their physical and menta wellbeing.",date:"09/12/2023"},{img:"https://res.cloudinary.com/dby2vbxv3/image/upload/v1726738923/KPGU/Events/Internal%20Complaint%20Committee/abc3_Custom_ul74wo.jpg",title:"Menopause Awareness seminar",des:"An awareness program was held on 17/4/23 for educating them about the Awareness of Sexual Harassment of Women in the Workplace highlighting the importance and significance ponl office Order of the act.",date:"18/10/2023"},{img:"https://res.cloudinary.com/dby2vbxv3/image/upload/v1726738923/KPGU/Events/Internal%20Complaint%20Committee/abc4_Custom_c9fgui.jpg",title:"An awareness program Sanitary vending machine Women in the Workplace",des:"An awareness program was held educating them about the Sexual Harassment of Women in the Workplace based on the UGC Guidelines from 9/12/23 to 14/12/23 highlighting Key elements of Workplace Sexual Harassment, Behaviours, and scenarios that constitute sexual harassment, Preventive Authorities and Sanitary Pad disposal bins and Vending Machines.",date:"17/04/2023"}];return r.jsxs(r.Fragment,{children:[r.jsx(Ke,{value:t,children:r.jsx(w,{className:"smooth-shadow",bgcolor:"rgba(256, 256, 256, 0.6)",sx:{backdropFilter:"blur(10px)"},p:2,borderRadius:4,mt:7,position:"sticky",top:0,maxWidth:e,mx:"auto",zIndex:99999999,children:r.jsxs(Ve,{onChange:a,"aria-label":"lab API tabs example",orientation:"horizontal",textColor:"secondary",indicatorColor:"secondary",variant:"scrollable",children:[r.jsx(G,{className:"align-items-start fw-bold text-start  fs-6",label:"About",value:"1",href:"#about"}),r.jsx(G,{className:"align-items-start fw-bold text-start  fs-6",label:"Objectives",value:"2",href:"#objectives"}),r.jsx(G,{className:"align-items-start fw-bold text-start  fs-6",label:"Committee Members",value:"3",href:"#committee-members"}),r.jsx(G,{className:"align-items-start fw-bold text-start  fs-6",label:"Procedure",value:"4",href:"#procedure"}),r.jsx(G,{className:"align-items-start fw-bold text-start  fs-6",label:"Contact Us",value:"5",href:"#contact"}),r.jsx(G,{className:"align-items-start fw-bold text-start  fs-6",label:"Attachments",value:"6",href:"#attachments"}),r.jsx(G,{className:"align-items-start fw-bold text-start  fs-6",label:"Activities",value:"7",href:"#events"})]})})}),r.jsx("div",{id:"about",children:r.jsxs(w,{maxWidth:e,mx:"auto",px:"3%",py:"2%",bgcolor:"#fff",mt:7,borderRadius:4,className:"smooth-shadow",textAlign:{xs:"start",sm:"justify"},children:[r.jsx("h3",{className:"fw-bold color-secondary ",children:"Internal Compliant Committee (ICC)"}),r.jsx("h5",{className:"fw-semibold mb-3 ",children:"In pursuance of “University Grants Commission (Prevention, Prohibition and Redressal of Sexual harassment of Women Employees and Students in higher educational institutions) Regulations, 2015 read with Sexual Harassment of Women at work place (Prevention, Prohibition and Redressal) Act 2013, Drs. Kiran & Pallavi Patel Global University (KPGU) has constituted the Internal Complaints Committee (ICC) to deal with complaint relating the sexual harassment of women employees and students at the university."}),r.jsx("h5",{className:"fw-semibold mb-3 ",children:"To prevent the victim from being persuaded to withdraw their accusations by the offender(s), the committee accepts complaints from victims and maintains their confidentiality. The committee firmly deals with all instances of sexual harassment and assault. The committee not only pursues retributive measures against sexual harassment offender(s) but also makes an effort to raise awareness of it through sensitization initiatives. The ICC addresses the problems immediately and takes appropriate actions. Thus, the employees and students feel entirely safe on campus. Thanks to this swift resolution mechanism."})]})}),r.jsx("div",{id:"objectives",children:r.jsxs(w,{maxWidth:e,mx:"auto",px:"3%",py:"2%",bgcolor:"#fff",mt:7,borderRadius:4,className:"smooth-shadow",textAlign:{xs:"start",sm:"justify"},children:[r.jsx("h3",{className:"fw-bold color-secondary ",children:"Objectives of the ICC"}),r.jsx("h5",{className:"mb-2 p-2 smooth-shadow-card rounded-2 color-secondary fw-bold ",children:"To increase awareness of sexual harassment through educational programs that support and promote a respectful and secure campus environment."}),r.jsx("h5",{className:"mb-2 p-2 smooth-shadow-card rounded-2 color-secondary fw-bold ",children:"To deal with situations of discrimination and sexual harassment against women promptly to ensure support services for the harmed and the cessation of the harassment. Inform complainants of the informal and formal mechanisms of settlement as outlined by the Cell."}),r.jsx("h5",{className:"mb-2 p-2 smooth-shadow-card rounded-2 color-secondary fw-bold ",children:"To offer an unbiased, secretive, and encouraging setting for any victims of sexual abuse."}),r.jsx("h5",{className:"mb-2 p-2 smooth-shadow-card rounded-2 color-secondary fw-bold ",children:"Advocate suitable sanctions against the offender"}),r.j