d from Govt. Agencies : 3 Cr (Startup India- GOI) + 2 CR (SSIP- GOG)","Nodal Institute of Startup Gujarat Cell (Industry Commissionerate-GOG)","2200+  Startup Applications Received for incubation","36 Startups supported financially","50+ Startups incubated ","75+ Mentors on board","17.65 Crore Revenue Generated by Startups","110+ jobs created by Startups","Recognition award for excellent work by Startup Vadodara Community and ICAI ","Ranked among top 5 incubators under Startup India."];return r.jsxs(r.Fragment,{children:[r.jsxs(w,{maxWidth:e,mx:"auto",p:"3%",bgcolor:"#fff",mt:7,borderRadius:4,className:"smooth-shadow",children:[r.jsx("h3",{className:"fw-bold color-secondary ",children:"About Krishna Educational Foundation (KEF)"}),r.jsx("h5",{className:"fw-semibold mb-3 ",children:"Krishna Educational Foundation (KEF), Vadodara, Gujarat is a registered Section 8 company under Companies Act 2013, promoted by Drs Kiran & Pallavi Patel Global University (KPGU), Vadodara, Gujarat. The incubator is actively engaged in harnessing the entrepreneurial potential of startups by providing end to end support through seed funds, access to infrastructure in terms of co-working Space & access to lab facilities comprising sophisticated equipment along with mentoring and networking platforms for start-ups by community building with wide range of the Industry Mentors, Investors, Government Stakeholders and Entrepreneurs to establish a leading market venture."}),r.jsx("h5",{className:"fw-semibold mb-3 ",children:"KEF envisions to acts as a collaborative platform that helps transform early-stage Startups into business ventures that make significant economic and social impact."}),r.jsx($,{variant:"contained",color:"secondary",size:"large",disableElevation:!0,href:"https://krishnaedufoundation.com/",target:"_blank",children:"Visit Website"})]}),r.jsxs(w,{maxWidth:e,mx:"auto",p:"3%",bgcolor:"#fff",mt:4,borderRadius:4,className:"smooth-shadow",children:[r.jsx("h3",{className:"fw-bold color